<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Arrow raised by Morgan.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Arrow raised by Morgan.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it upgraded Arrow International Inc to outperform from neutral.</p>
<p>-- The stock closed at 28-1/4 Thursday.</p>
</text>
